    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "458004c2-2f2b-40bf-8fd7-cad968995e49",
      "key": "407b4787-63f4-4eaf-8d1f-e0616d37fa8e",
      "values": []
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "a50e00a5-2b83-49de-a74c-711fd0013718",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHalf board accommodation\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursions \u0026amp; guided tours included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBlue Badge guide Days 2 to 4\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach throughout\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOne free place per 10 paying passengers\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "fee0e139-4ccd-4d64-a877-a56028740f88",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EFour nights on half board basis at the 3* Celtic Royal Hotel. Located in the centre of Caernarfon, facilities at the hotel include a restaurant, bar and swimming pool and all rooms are en suite.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "f39769fd-e54a-48b8-a282-9d2cbddc5432",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAttingham Park\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECaernarfon Castle - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPlas Newydd - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFfestiniog Railway\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPortmeirion Village\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBodnant Gardens\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EConwy Castle - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPowis Castle \u0026amp; Garden\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "db235cdd-2aea-4677-a294-e7a8165816f5",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESnowdon Mountain Railway - an awe inspiring journey by Britain\u2019s only rack and pinion railway to the summit of Snowdon\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPontcysyllte Aqueduct - boat excursion across the famous aqueduct built by Thomas Telford between 1795 and 1805 and which, according to UNESCO, represents a \u0026#39;masterpiece of human creative genius\u0026#39;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPenrhyn Castle - the first Lord Penrhyn, the owner of a nearby slate mine and also sugar plantations in the West Indies, filled his late 18th century neo-Norman fantasy castle with his amazing collection of paintings and other treasures\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPlas Mawr - built by Robert Wynn between 1576 and 1585, with elaborately decorated plaster ceilings and fine wooden screens, this is possibly the UK\u2019s best preserved Elizabethan town house\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGwydir Castle - built in the 1500\u2019s by the illustrious Wynn family, a fine example of a Tudor courtyard house, incorporating reused medieval material from the dissolved Abbey of Maenan\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPlas Brondanw Gardens - not as famous as his village of Portmeirion, but widely regarded to be Sir Clough Williams-Ellis\u2019 masterpiece\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe \u2018Marble Church\u2019 - the Church of St Margaret of Antioch in Bodelwyddan boasts an interior featuring marble from Ireland, England, France and Italy and fine Victorian stained glass windows\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EErddig - one of the most fascinating houses in Britain with an evocative range of outbuildings and state rooms displaying original 18th and 19th century furnishings\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Here are some more suggested places of interest you might like to include:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "5f49cf5e-af25-4942-9d15-12a2c9b5b777",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 \u2013 Attingham Park\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoard our private executive coach at your preferred pick up points \u2013 stop at a convenient property en route such as Attingham Park near Shrewsbury, an elegant 18th century mansion with magnificent Regency interiors and silver, period furniture and painting collections \u2013 continue to the 3* Celtic Royal Hotel in Caernarfon.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Caernarfon Castle \u0026amp; Plas Newydd\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Caernarfon Castle, constructed in 1283 as the definitive chapter in Edward I\u2019s conquest of Wales \u2013 guided tour of the National Trust\u2019s beautiful 18th century house at Plas Newydd, home of the Marquess of Anglesey and a mixture of classic and Gothic styles with wonderful views of Snowdonia.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Ffestiniog Narrow Gauge Railway \u0026amp; Portmeirion Village\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ETake the scenic Ffestiniog Narrow Gauge Railway from Blaenau Festiniog to Porthmadog Station where we are met once again by our coach \u2013 transfer the short distance to Portmeirion, built by Clough Williams-Ellis between 1925 and 1975 in the style of an Italian village.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013 Bodnant Gardens \u0026amp; Conwy Castle\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOne of the world\u2019s most spectacular gardens, the National Trust\u2019s 80 acre Bodnant Gardens located above the River Conwy features huge Italianate terraces and stunning views across Snowdonia \u2013 guided tour of Conwy Castle, completed in 1287 and one of Edward I\u2019s chain of Welsh fortresses.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 Powis Castle \u0026amp; Garden\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe world famous garden at the National Trust\u2019s Powis Castle and Garden was laid out under the influence of Italian and French styles and retains its original lead statues, while the medieval castle contains one of the finest collections of paintings and furniture in Wales \u2013 return to our original departure points with comfort stops en route.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Every one of our tours is exclusively for your group and your group alone so each one can be tailor made to suit the interests and profile of your members until you have a tour with an itinerary and at a price which matches the interests and profile of your members."
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember this itinerary is just our suggestion. "
          }
        }
      ]
    },
